ReadTables root;data

VGET←⎕VGET ⋄ VSET←⎕VSET

data←root,'/Data/'
:For (table file) :In ↓TABLES
    VSET ⊂table (ReadCSV data,file)
:EndFor

(LANGTXT LANGUAGES)←1↓⍤1¨⎕CSV⍠('DoubleQuote' 1)('QuoteChar' '"')('Separator' ';')⊢(data,'Text.csv') ⍬ ⍬ 1
SelectLanguage 1

DOCS←ReadDocs root,'/Documents/'
APPNAME←(⊃⎕NGET data,'AppName.txt')~⎕UCS 13 10
